summary:
We developed a project called NASA: Project Titan. It is an immersive game that blends sci-fi with realistic space mission concepts. Here, players can take on the collective role of an entire space agency by stepping into the unknown of spacecraft design. In Project: Titan, players are responsible for maintaining the criterion such as budget, engine efficiency and mission suitability with the intentions of experiencing exciting driving mechanics that are easy to pick up.

It directly addresses the Space Mission Design Game challenge by transforming aerospace mission planning into an interactive, multi-disciplinary simulation.&nbsp; 

Crucially, our primary goal is not to teach, but rather to cultivate a deep sense of curiosity and wonder about the universe. Hence, by building up a atmosphere where space exploration is thrilling and accessible through entertaining gameplay, Project Titan inspires younger generations and the broader public, igniting a lasting passion for the rising space sector.
